    {
      "html": "<hr/>\n<div style=\"font-size: smaller; float: left; padding-right: 10px\">\n<a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/Burlington27/Burlington2704.html#wwfootnote_inline_84\" name=\"84\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/Burlington27/Burlington2704.html&amp;anchor=wwfootnote_inline_84\">1</a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"Footnote\"><span class=\"bold\">Charter reference—</span>Power of city council to compel snow and ice removal, § <a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH03.html#48\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH03.html&amp;anchor=48\">48</a>(XXIII).</p>\n<p class=\"Footnote\"><span class=\"bold\">State law reference—</span>Authority of municipality to provide for the removal of snow and ice, <a href=\"http://legislature.vermont.gov/statutes/title/24\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">24</a> V.S.A. § <a href=\"http://legislature.vermont.gov/statutes/section/24/061/02291\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2291</a>(2).</p>\n<br/>",
      "text": "1 Charter reference—Power of city council to compel snow and ice removal, § 48(XXIII). State law reference—Authority of municipality to provide for the removal of snow and ice, 24 V.S.A. § 2291(2).",
